              "text": "The Skull Probe is one of the many types of mechanical servitors the Imperial forces employ. They are constructed from the cranium of extraordinarily devout retainers so as they can continue to lend their abilities and serve the Imperium even after their deaths. Unarmed but equipped with a myriad of sensor instruments, a Skull Probe can relay a complete report of its surroundings to its masters, not letting any enemy units close unobserved.\n",
